# Netlify routing (copied into dist/ on build).
#
# 1) API: forward /api/* to the FastAPI backend (Netlify drag-and-drop can't run Python).
#    Replace the URL with your backend's address, then rebuild and re-drop dist/.
#    Example for a Hugging Face Space:  https://<user>-<space>.hf.space/api/:splat
# /api/*  https://YOUR-BACKEND-URL/api/:splat  200

# 2) Single-page app: every other path serves index.html so /check works on refresh.
/*  /index.html  200
